[{"id":2972849230,"node_id":"PRR_kwDOAO6SJc6xMhRO","state":"COMMENTED","user":{"site_admin":false,"suspended":false,"updated_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/180032?u=68d23e7ee9cdf810da125e8510b72f845b9dccc8&v=4","created_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","followers":0,"following":0,"html_url":"https://github.com/Calinou","id":180032,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4MDAzMg==","login":"Calinou","type":"User","owned_private_repos":0,"public_gists":0,"public_repos":0,"total_private_repos":0,"url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou"},"body":"Tested locally, it mostly works as expected (both with shadows enabled and disabled).\r\n\r\n**Testing project:** [test_pr_107384.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/20987560/test_pr_107384.zip)\r\n\r\n## Preview\r\n\r\nForward+ | Mobile | Compatibility\r\n-|-|-\r\n![Image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/51fcab00-0610-4f95-af13-beb429c37a0b) | ![Image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/14e16d9d-33af-440e-a8f9-0b7439db2d16) | ![Image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/733f81c8-0927-4e3a-9900-665f528713ac)\r\n\r\nOne issue I encountered while testing is that I've had a situation where it looked like this in Compatibility (each screenshot taken in a different session):\r\n\r\n![Image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/370d6fe5-793e-4879-99c1-b7b41809a58f) | ![Image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/7995af88-0198-4410-81ac-f2b3156ae451)\r\n-|-\r\n![Image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/24a52289-8b1c-4fc9-8501-057381272cac) | ![Image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/f04098f4-0e1d-4ec8-97e1-1530af184937)\r\n\r\nIt seems to sporadically occur on startup, and is possibly due to uninitialized memory somewhere (which leads to undefined behavior). I've also had one situation where it appeared to render correctly, but part of the sky was pure black. This doesn't occur on `master`.\r\n\r\nA quick way to test is to use **Debug > Customize Run Instances...**, enable multiple instances and increase the instance count to a value your PC can handle (up to 20).","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/107384#pullrequestreview-2972849230","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/107384","author_association":"MEMBER","submitted_at":"2025-06-30T21:50:16Z"},{"id":2979530979,"node_id":"PRR_kwDOAO6SJc6xmAjj","state":"COMMENTED","user":{"site_admin":false,"suspended":false,"updated_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/180032?u=68d23e7ee9cdf810da125e8510b72f845b9dccc8&v=4","created_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","followers":0,"following":0,"html_url":"https://github.com/Calinou","id":180032,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4MDAzMg==","login":"Calinou","type":"User","owned_private_repos":0,"public_gists":0,"public_repos":0,"total_private_repos":0,"url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou"},"body":"The issue I reported above appears to be fixed now (tested over 20 launches in Compatibility).","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/107384#pullrequestreview-2979530979","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/107384","author_association":"MEMBER","submitted_at":"2025-07-02T15:00:58Z"},{"id":2979534250,"node_id":"PRR_kwDOAO6SJc6xmBWq","state":"APPROVED","user":{"site_admin":false,"suspended":false,"updated_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/180032?u=68d23e7ee9cdf810da125e8510b72f845b9dccc8&v=4","created_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","followers":0,"following":0,"html_url":"https://github.com/Calinou","id":180032,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4MDAzMg==","login":"Calinou","type":"User","owned_private_repos":0,"public_gists":0,"public_repos":0,"total_private_repos":0,"url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou"},"body":"","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/107384#pullrequestreview-2979534250","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repo